WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.273
Scenario: An AI assistant produces an incident-response memo citing

2
00:00:03.273 --> 00:00:06.545
a non-existent CVE and recommending a command that would

3
00:00:06.545 --> 00:00:09.818
disable endpoint protection across all workstations. Safest response: Option

4
00:00:09.818 --> 00:00:13.091
B: Treat it as an unverified draft, validate every

5
00:00:13.091 --> 00:00:16.364
source and recommendation against authoritative advisories and approved procedures,

6
00:00:16.364 --> 00:00:19.636
and reject unsafe actions. AI output needs provenance, technical

7
00:00:19.636 --> 00:00:22.909
validation, and human approval before it informs operational response.

8
00:00:22.909 --> 00:00:26.182
Option A is unsafe because Citations and fluent technical

9
00:00:26.182 --> 00:00:29.455
prose do not establish factual accuracy or safety. Option

10
00:00:29.455 --> 00:00:32.727
C is unsafe because Testing an unsafe command on

11
00:00:32.727 --> 00:00:36.000
