13
00:00:39.273 --> 00:00:42.545
Self-confirmation by the same model is not independent evidence

14
00:00:42.545 --> 00:00:45.818
and may reproduce the original error. In practice: Check

15
00:00:45.818 --> 00:00:49.091
identifiers in authoritative vulnerability databases and vendor advisories, test

16
00:00:49.091 --> 00:00:52.364
